#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1047
msgid "Sampling Tool"
msgstr "Stickprovsverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1049
msgid "Sampling Tool Dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan för stickprovsverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1051
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-sampling.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the "
"sampling tool.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-sampling.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>Stickprovsverktyget.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1062
msgid ""
"Use the sampling tool to take a sample of a data set. This tool can take "
"both a random sample of a given size or a periodic sample:"
msgstr ""
"Använd stickprovsverktyget för att ta ett stickprov ur en datamängd. "
"Verktyget kan ta ett slumpmässigt stickprov av en viss storlek eller ett "
"periodiskt stickprov:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1066 C/gnumeric.xml:1085
msgid "random sample"
msgstr "slumpmässigt stickprov"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1067
msgid ""
"A random sample is a subset of the population such that every subset of that"
" size has the same chance of being picked."
msgstr ""
"Ett slumpmässigt stickprov är en delmängd av populationen där varje delmängd"
" av samma storlek har lika stor sannolikhet att väljas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1070 C/gnumeric.xml:1089
msgid "periodic sample"
msgstr "periodiskt stickprov"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1071
msgid ""
"In a periodic sample every <parameter>k</parameter>th element in the "
"population is selected."
msgstr ""
"I ett periodiskt stickprov väljs vart <parameter>k</parameter>:e element i "
"populationen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1076
msgid ""
"To use this tool, first specify the data set or data sets by setting the "
"<quote><guilabel>Input Range:</guilabel></quote> entry. The range or ranges "
"given can be grouped into datasets by rows, by columns, or by areas."
msgstr ""
"Ange först vilken eller vilka datamängder som ska användas i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Indataområde:</guilabel></quote>. Området eller områdena "
"kan delas in i datamängder efter rader, kolumner eller områden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1079
msgid ""
"If the first entry in each data set contains a variable, select the "
"<quote><guilabel>Labels</guilabel></quote> option."
msgstr ""
"Om den första posten i varje datamängd innehåller ett variabelnamn markerar "
"du <quote><guilabel>Rubriker</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1082
msgid "Select the sampling method which can be either periodic or random."
msgstr "Välj urvalsmetod: periodisk eller slumpmässig."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1086
msgid ""
"Specify the size of the random sample in the <quote><guilabel>Size of "
"Sample:</guilabel></quote> entry."
msgstr ""
"Ange storleken på det slumpmässiga stickprovet i fältet "
"<quote><guilabel>Storlek på stickprov:</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1090
msgid ""
"Specify the period in the <quote><guilabel>Period:</guilabel></quote> entry."
msgstr "Ange perioden i fältet <quote><guilabel>Period:</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1095
msgid ""
"Specify the number of samples you would like to obtain in the "
"<quote><guilabel> Number of Samples:</guilabel></quote> entry."
msgstr ""
"Ange hur många stickprov du vill ta i fältet <quote><guilabel> Antal "
"stickprov:</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1097
msgid ""
"Since the period uniquely determines a periodic sample, if you specify that "
"you would like 2 samples you will be given the identical sample twice."
msgstr ""
"Eftersom perioden entydigt bestämmer ett periodiskt stickprov får du samma "
"stickprov två gånger om du anger att du vill ta 2 stickprov."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1099
msgid ""
"If the dataset for a periodic sample is a two dimensional range, "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> will enumerate the data points by row "
"first."
msgstr ""
"Om datamängden för ett periodiskt stickprov består av ett tvådimensionellt "
"område räknar <application>Gnumeric</application> datapunkterna radvis "
"först."

